      "composition": "framed-scene",
      "description": "The whole pond miniature of the leaf. Between two gold columns with scroll capitals, a brown ape crouches at the left on a green bank holding a fishing rod whose line drops into a blue pond, while a grey-brown long-beaked waterbird dives head first into the water at the right. Green hills, trees with red and gold fruit, clumps of gold-lined reeds and a pale blue sky fill the ground, bounded by a thin gold bar above and a gold plinth below. Opaque inside the frame, transparent outside.",
